/** A Linear record of a project on a connected Jira site that has been imported, synced with a team, or both. id is the Linear UUID; externalId and key identify the project in Jira. team describes the active sync destination, while linearTeam can also identify the destination of the latest import. Projects never imported or synced are not listed. */
