/** An OAuth application created and managed by another OAuth application through this API. id identifies the record for management mutations, while clientId identifies it in OAuth flows. The returned object includes branding, redirect URIs, grant capabilities, and webhook settings, but no secrets. Applications created here start private to the current workspace. */
