/** A comment on a pull request, synced bidirectionally with the hosting provider (e.g., GitHub). Comments can be top-level or threaded replies, and may be associated with specific code locations via an anchor. Comments belonging to a pending review are not visible to other users or synced to the provider until the review is submitted. */
