/** A subscription that delivers Linear events to your HTTPS endpoint as signed HTTP POST requests. resourceTypes selects the event streams, while the team settings limit which team events are included. Manually created webhooks have their own URL and signing secret; OAuth application webhooks use the application’s configuration. Verify payload signatures before processing events, and use enabled to pause delivery without deleting the subscription. */
