/** The saved configuration for an automation, including Loops, triage rules, SLAs, release automations, and view notification subscriptions. triggerType and trigger describe what can start it; conditions and activationMode decide which events qualify; activities describe what it does. The enabled flag controls execution. Scope relations, such as team or project, determine where the workflow belongs and who can access it. */
